  "description": "One ordinary day, Annabel recalled memories of her past life and realized she had reincarnated as the second lead character in a novel who destined to face consequences for all the wrongs done to the male lead, ultimately ending up in prison! \n\nTo prevent the imminent doom, Annabel begins to thwart each conspiracy she had laid out, rescuing Ian from danger. However, Ian suddenly starts to show an unusual obsession. \n\n“Lately, why aren’t you saying harsh things to me? Insult me... please.” \n\nThis man seems to have become somewhat peculiar! \n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)",
